          "points": 0.2,
          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>What is the output of the following code?</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Rectangle</span> {\n   <span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">marks</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>;\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Main</span> {\n   <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">static</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">main</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(String... args)</span> {\n      <span class=\"hljs-type\">Rectangle</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">s</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Rectangle</span>();\n      <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">switch</span> (s.marks) {\n         <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">default</span>:\n            System.out.println(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;A&quot;</span>);\n         <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">case</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>:\n            System.out.println(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;B&quot;</span>);\n         <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">case</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">100</span>:\n            System.out.println(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;C&quot;</span>);\n   }\n  }\n}</code></pre></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Kết quả của đoạn mã sau là gì?</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Rectangle</span> {\n   <span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">marks</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>;\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Main</span> {\n   <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">static</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">main</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(String... args)</span> {\n      <span class=\"hljs-type\">Rectangle</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">s</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Rectangle</span>();\n      <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">switch</span> (s.marks) {\n         <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">default</span>:\n            System.out.println(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;A&quot;</span>);\n         <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">case</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>:\n            System.out.println(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;B&quot;</span>);\n         <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">case</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">100</span>:\n            System.out.println(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;C&quot;</span>);\n   }\n  }\n}</code></pre></div>",
